cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the manuscript it accompanies."
title: "TRACK: Telemetry-Based Racing Analysis and Coaching Kit"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, notebooks and documentation for a telemetry-based study of
  driving behavior in sim racing. The pipeline segments corners, computes a
  four-dimensional behavioral fingerprint over 19 metrics, clusters recording
  sessions, and normalizes human metrics against a reinforcement-learning
  reference agent.
type: software
